    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3725660/extras/186f2b229c17c79bab45c12516654d00.avif?t=1748286428\" width=586 height=96 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Depths of Anathel is an Idle/Incremental adventure game offering a more relaxed way of numbers going &quot;up&quot;. With a single click eliminate a variety of enemies and explore dangerous dungeons to unveil secrets and acquire rare loot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game offers a combination of 14 life skills (like mining, gem cutting, weapon smithing... ) to level up. Also there are 17 combat skills that are weapon/stat based like great swords scaling with your strength stat level or scepters scaling with your spirit stat level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3725660/extras/4dfa45a400e46d20e03e79fa4d92476b.avif?t=1748286428\" width=588 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is just a side project that begun from the need to have something on my second monitor. I plan to implement more features using the community's feedback and improve the game as the time passes.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Some Tech Things:</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is developed using React 18 and Typescript.<br>It's using Redux for state management,<br>And electron to package and deliver it as desktop application.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3725660/extras/186f2b229c17c79bab45c12516654d00.avif?t=1748286428\" width=586 height=96 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Depths of Anathel is an Idle/Incremental adventure game offering a more relaxed way of numbers going &quot;up&quot;. With a single click eliminate a variety of enemies and explore dangerous dungeons to unveil secrets and acquire rare loot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game offers a combination of 14 life skills (like mining, gem cutting, weapon smithing... ) to level up. Also there are 17 combat skills that are weapon/stat based like great swords scaling with your strength stat level or scepters scaling with your spirit stat level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3725660/extras/4dfa45a400e46d20e03e79fa4d92476b.avif?t=1748286428\" width=588 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is just a side project that begun from the need to have something on my second monitor. I plan to implement more features using the community's feedback and improve the game as the time passes.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Some Tech Things:</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is developed using React 18 and Typescript.<br>It's using Redux for state management,<br>And electron to package and deliver it as desktop application.</p>",
